                  "severity": "High",
                  "title": "Login without server-side verification",
                  "type": "Spoofing",
                  "description": "The application may accept a login based only on client-side validation without properly verifying the user's credentials and identity on the server.",
                  "mitigation": "Perform authentication on the server. Verify passwords securely using a strong password hashing algorithm and issue a secure session after successful authentication."
                }
              ],
              "isWebApplication": true,
